 "note": "M, 18 platforms. A wide crescent bowing down like a smile, the homes on its two horns. Three ways round: the inner arc along the top, the middle lane through the crescent's body and the deep outer arc, with rungs between them. The stone inside each horn (X) is a SPEED relay driving its side's outer arc: at the start both outer arcs run fast down toward the bottom; firing one reverses its side, so the whole outer arc becomes a one-way fast road into that side's home (take the enemy's to rush in, take yours back to shut it). The centre is a ROTOR (R): at the start it carries the inner arc straight through - the short way between the homes; fired, it swings to the middle lane's two stones and cuts the inner arc at the middle (armies drop down the lens sides to the middle lane). Finale: the lens round the rotor - the inner arc's middle, the two stones below it and the curved bottom.",
 "geometricSymmetry": true,
